[size=6][b]WaveOptimiser — Heat Wave Performance Fix for StarRupture[/b][/size]

[b]Found a bug? Report it on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/AlienXAXS/StarRupture-Plugin-WaveOptimiser/issues]https://github.com/AlienXAXS/StarRupture-Plugin-WaveOptimiser/issues[/url][/b] and attach your [b]ModLoader.log[/b] (in [b]Binaries\Win64\ModLoader\Logs\[/b]).

Reduces the large freezes that can occur when heat waves begin on large save files by spreading the workload over multiple frames.

[b]Works on both client and server[/b]

[line]

[size=5][b]What It Does[/b][/size]

During heat waves, StarRupture can process tens of thousands of entities in a single frame, causing severe stuttering or multi-second freezes on larger worlds.

WaveOptimiser distributes this work across multiple game ticks, significantly reducing the impact on gameplay while preserving normal heat wave behaviour.

This is especially beneficial for large factories and long-running save files.

[line]

[size=5][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Download the correct file from the [b]Files[/b] tab.
[list]
[*]Client version[/*]
[*]Server version[/*]
[/list][/*]
[*]Open the ZIP file.
[/*]
[*]Copy the contents of the included Plugins folder into:
[i]"StarRupture\Binaries\Win64\ModLoader\Plugins"[/i]
[/*]
[*]Launch the game or server once to generate the config file.
[/*]
[*]Ensure the plugin is enabled in:
[i]"Plugins\config\WaveOptimiser.ini"[/i][/*]
[/list][line]

[size=5][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

Config file:

[i]"Plugins\config\WaveOptimiser.ini"[/i]

The configuration file is generated automatically on first launch.

[line]

[size=5][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Plugin not loading[/b] — check [i]"modloader.log in Binaries\Win64"[/i]
[/*]
[*][b]Issues after a game update[/b] — the plugin may require an update after major game patches[/*]
[/list][line]

